### Get and filter list data based on query params - Country

GET https://localhost:8443/listData?list_id=1969
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Country
GET https://localhost:8443/listData?list_id=1969&country=Brazil
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### subState
GET https://localhost:8443/listData?list_id=1969&subState=Abaí
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Country, page, pageSize
GET https://localhost:8443/listData?list_id=1969&country=Brazil&page=0&pageSize=5
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Country, sortByAttribute, order
GET https://localhost:8443/listData?list_id=1969&country=Brazil&sortByAttribute=State&order=desc
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

#"country": "Brazil"
#"state": "Bahia"
#"subState": "Barreiras"
#"page": 1
#"pageSize": 10
#"analysisArea": 500000
#"sortByAttribute": "State"
#"order": 'desc'

### Country, sortByAttribute, order
POST https://localhost:8443/listDataCustom
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
# =======================================
# DEV environment list - 365 locations
# List name - White screen 2405
# List ID - 2016
# =======================================

{
  "list_ids": [2016],
  "columnsToReturn": "Latitude,Longitude,location_id",
  "filters": {
    "orderType": "asc",
    "sortByAttribute": "location_id",
    "selectedCountry": "Costa Rica",
    "selectedState": "Alajuela",
    "selectedSubState": "Grecia",
    "selectedAreaMin": 0,
    "selectedAreaMax": null
  }
}


### Country, sortByAttribute, order
GET https://localhost:8443/api/list/5407/commodity
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Get List of specific commodity
GET https://localhost:8443/api/list/by-commodity?commodity=other
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}
